The original fdr daemon design -- isolated tracefs instances,
configuration-driven probe management, and trace_pipe harvesting to
bounded log files -- was created by Oracle. This project extends and
modifies that foundation with additional capabilities, including but
not limited to: HTTP health/readiness/Prometheus endpoints, expanded
process supervision and transactional reload handling, Kubernetes
and Helm deployment tooling, and an expanded test and validation
suite.

